AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000053> "has symmetry is a top-level object property which gathers other symmetry/lattice system-specific object properties for the inference of family of directions/planes Miller indices notation"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000053> owl:topObjectProperty)

