# Class: <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000075> (Euler angles)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000075> "By aligning coordinate system of every crystal in the sample to the sample's coordinate system, anisotropy of material's properties can be investigated.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000075> "Euler angles"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000075> "Euler angles are three angles which describe orientation of a sinlge crystal in respect to the sample's coordinate system"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000075> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000027>)
